  kind: 1
  title: Fried Chicken
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Fried Chicken


    Chicken,
    cut up on the board

    A good pinch of salt


    Fry it till it''s brown all
    over and cooked through. Feeds two.'
  marginNote: Don't walk away from the stove. It burns quicker than you'd think.
